{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f7941a0527b57a41075b1e047be52303b6afbea2d308bf252b22995caa5f4d96", "ja": "勝利の一手", "zh": "制胜一招", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e3665ae6186ab6779e08664d50ae455f9235f15682cb0725cf46214070017dca", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭当日。なるは、真珠星に湊への\n想いを告白。バックダンサー試験とは真逆に\n「手加減して」と告げる。動揺した真珠星は\n思うようなパフォーマンスができず、新人賞\nは『Vermilion Red』が獲得する。", "zh": "Astro歌谣祭当天。成向真珠星告白了\n自己对凑的心意。与伴舞选拔时截然相反，\n她对真珠星说“对我手下留情吧”。动摇的真珠星\n未能发挥出应有的水平，新人奖\n最终由“Vermilion Red”斩获。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0e884044e93fd6e4621d5c035c759309a24eb8f6e17afb226cbe4a51ec065818", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭当日……", "zh": "Astro歌谣祭当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "07aaef66b521ee7b964417acb670e5072b08124e9ed2f1ddebfdf346e2f859b4", "ja": "ごめんね、真珠星ちゃん。\n本番前なのに、急に呼び出したりして。", "zh": "对不起，珍珠星。\n明明马上就要正式演出了，还突然把你叫出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "0447df666c97a3d5ca063b789850b9975cf7271039f43eb1d970db2b077c2c32", "ja": "ううん。\nけど、話って……？", "zh": "不会。\n不过，要跟我说什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "17d4473a58e0eec40ec436faa85f2c9295aa5f9b476b57de5bb4201d307669c9", "ja": "あのね。私は、真珠星ちゃんに勝てないかもしれない。\nアイドルとしてだけじゃなく……恋でも。", "zh": "那个啊。我可能……赢不了真珠星。\n不仅是作为偶像……在恋爱上也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "1dbfebcac82eab8c4c717110b34d7f344678191411b961c848109df9b241ab8b", "ja": "……恋？\nえ、恋って……。", "zh": "……恋爱？\n咦，恋爱是指……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "b8d50d220debc1b61cdf302faf8cf30f8b565f5d8fe71ccc1741912c47cdef24", "ja": "アイドルは、私の憧れ。押し付けられたんじゃない。\n自分で選んだ、大切なもの……。", "zh": "偶像，是我所憧憬的存在。不是别人强加给我的。\n而是我自己选择的、珍贵的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "23a4a5f55852dc91834d6a3acb3fbd45b57c61e026762597b0a1e33ecf9bf1c2", "ja": "それで、湊くんは……芸能界の幼馴染みたいな存在。\n……ずっと、心の支えだった。", "zh": "所以，湊……就像是我在演艺圈里的青梅竹马一样。  \n……一直以来，都是支撑我内心的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e5b32a00a486bc28be819214f792e588e263ebbed792911b5ad952d4c47ff433", "ja": "私にとって、大切なふたつ……\nそれが、真珠星ちゃんに奪われちゃうかもしれない。", "zh": "对我来说，两个重要的东西……\n它们可能会被真珠星夺走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "af2fa8f59c686d967648919664b8382dbddaaca2129dcede0078c7ce0a62be44", "ja": "う、奪う！？　待って、なるちゃん！\n私はそんなつもり、全然……！", "zh": "抢、抢走！？等一下，小鸣！\n我完全没有那个意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "31764c9cfac99a854e2a5e3d77b70efb4d4d7f583e32843038d0a0ccb0333f56", "ja": "……真珠星ちゃんにそのつもりがなくても、\n湊くんは違うんじゃないかな。", "zh": "……就算真珠星你没有那个意思，\n但凑同学可能不一样哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "42714fc4e25584c8eb855e043854d75316f6d3718c192907cc4007388b672da7", "ja": "でも私には、アイドルと同じくらい……\n湊くんが必要なの……。", "zh": "可是对我来说，湊君和偶像一样……都是不可或缺的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "438f5d5825a6ad3d244b99778d03e0610e98143414720c33ab174686ce1b6f36", "ja": "なるちゃん……。", "zh": "鸣……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "da2b3dba973f1e068b26d690d86278232af30e3300062d9a172d4d132ebe9f63", "ja": "お願い、手加減して。真珠星ちゃんは\n新人賞にも、湊くんにも興味ないでしょ？", "zh": "拜托，手下留情吧。真珠星对新人奖和湊都没兴趣吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "d07d379d5da0c72871f1a30efe060f33433c7816e516ba3582583532653bdda8", "ja": "！\nそ、それは……。", "zh": "！\n那、那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "492f5612f4f779bca419414f58a9a91c59ca8386fddded6d44d21943556206ac", "ja": "……それは……できないよ。\n藍さんにだって悪いし……。", "zh": "……那个……做不到。\n对蓝小姐也不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7b092f2818e52615d2ed6b226a88028d18c910b976c9238ecab9d610683f826", "ja": "いくらなるちゃんのお願いでも、できない。\n手加減なんて……。", "zh": "就算是小なる的请求，也不行。手下留情什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "d39ada947ecd966f05adb0aefc9b7311e87cd952b377565f9f2e99477115b0f3", "ja": "……そっか、そうだよね。\n変なこと言ってごめん。", "zh": "……这样啊，也对。\n对不起，说了奇怪的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "b12b7df5c7c42ac907c4e94c8296d33dd89ae361073e76fe7824324b463993a5", "ja": "そろそろ本番が始まるみたい。\n……行こう、真珠星ちゃん。", "zh": "好像马上就要正式开始了。\n……我们走吧，真珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1018_null", "source_sha256": "b66ced5b17b7953651c864f17d20a33b4b296398e823ffe7adda61dfc42d72d2", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭、本番……", "zh": "Astro歌谣祭，正式开演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "ebe5bb23bce81d7ed81ddbae60279f50051a177ca25597c3df600cb6e4bdd1bc", "ja": "はあ、はあ……！\n思った通りの動きが、全然……！", "zh": "哈、哈……！\n完全没能做出预想中的动作……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "b158a659236f7202bd9bb059b3e34c972cc0fe99fc0a4021acdae6a1d635c636", "ja": "コンディション調整ミスったわね。\nはぁ……アンタって、本当に……。", "zh": "状态调整失败了吧。\n唉……你这个人真是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "2c244638b994d7613e4209426d21873030810984df8495ca9046a9229dc8f331", "ja": "な、なに……？", "zh": "怎、怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "07b03d7403804c284aabe9e07330d4f15d51939c93f0dbb6403aaa29399fcb9f", "ja": "……まあいいわ。新人賞は\n『Vermilion Red』が獲るでしょ。", "zh": "……嘛，算了。新人奖肯定会由《Vermilion Red》拿下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "023ed5fa220049beb9c4d831c0a33fb8f674979c42818f8c4ea99c25a0691d99", "ja": "私たち以外で、あのクオリティに並べる\nアイドルなんて、この場にいないもの。", "zh": "在这里，除了我们之外，没有哪个偶像能达到那种水准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "3f377de34972c2dfc941b91884afdd982eebed08e2b3cda30ba6e2aa4d0ed65e", "ja": "そして、『Vermilion Red』……\nなるとクロエは、新人賞を獲得した。", "zh": "然后，《Vermilion Red》……Naru和Chloe获得了新人奖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "e75c59d64898ffdcf1f1ba9ee4bb70cef9523f6bc007acc142389258fb87e79b", "ja": "ちょっと！　さっき言いかけてたこと、なに？\n私、何かマズいことした？", "zh": "等一下！你刚才欲言又止的，究竟想说什么？\n难道我做了什么不该做的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "d377675a04cb41330e402223161a0cb433a4ea0dc1f802289a261b0746220804", "ja": "まだ気づいてないみたいだから、教えてあげる。\n本番前、なると話してたけど……。", "zh": "看来你还没察觉到呢，那我就告诉你吧。\n正式演出前，你不是在和鸣说话嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "c5fbfd0b6e2d7a742faeaf53702d59b331966aa1fb5302acb180f01a398774f2", "ja": "あんなお芝居も見抜けないなんて、\nアンタって本当にアホね、って言おうとしたのよ。", "zh": "连那种戏都看不出来，\n你可真够蠢的呢——本来打算这么说你的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "dabeb20260a5572478b3e84315651e86d3d855656d5fdc406db5f31c008ec414", "ja": "なっ！？\nていうか、え！？　お芝居って……。", "zh": "什、什！？  \n话说，诶！？　演戏……你是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "2dc67bd88e2591b02acbc67434138b4d75078e0fa415dec20aee041397ebb42c", "ja": "藍さん、気付いてたんですね。", "zh": "藍姐，您早就察觉到了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "195593f26ec63f75280b1fba47c39411513b670451a68a1d5a77f2b67521b488", "ja": "うん、そうなの。あれはお芝居。\nごめんね、真珠星ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。刚才是在演戏呢。\n对不起哦，真珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "9238dc7e1b55685215dbef5321a20d8eea7dfe93cbfb213035a18878b70a8202", "ja": "はぁぁ！？　ちょっ……信じられない！\n私は、本気で悩んでたのに……！", "zh": "哈啊！？等、等一下……真让人难以置信！\n我可是认真烦恼了好久的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "3beba1da8e889980274cec4b4666fb836c72c1c733eb8adcb16f26e27dc3158f", "ja": "うん。\n真珠星ちゃんなら、悩むだろうなと思った。", "zh": "嗯。\n我就想，换作真珠星的话，肯定会烦恼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "09206dfc5171bb3cc9f170bcde1e10e5491d4670d2a328bf82e4185e8052ffd0", "ja": "私、演技は得意なの。\n……これしか思いつかなくて。ごめんなさい。", "zh": "我演技很拿手的。\n……可我只想到了这个办法。对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b4820f17ca341f653fa9e9b6833527134468bd3dddb4445b61c9604862dc1d05", "ja": "いい手だったと思うよ。\n実際、真珠星は面白いくらい動揺してたし。", "zh": "我觉得挺管用的啊。\n实际上，真珠星也慌乱得很有意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "1dde573b2540e3100abc23b1f90d6211f9878f9f790ef1e4572330b9b29acfe7", "ja": "単純すぎて、真珠星くらいにしか\n通用しそうにないけどね。", "zh": "虽然简单得过头了，感觉也就只能对真珠星起作用呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "c688a67fe38e1b707c70d3f2f3ab90c7c1def7fcfe207a24b959138aa08715e3", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1037_024ann", "source_sha256": "706c10417cb45744367a2ed9a7bee19abfe811f55c10e18fb4f940e3133204ae", "ja": "……。\nなるちゃん。どうして……？", "zh": "……。\n鸣。为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "04d476af3de25e82aaa8726ff2b0801e03a8a92846f10cc0dca3f183a7222e34", "ja": "どうしても、勝たなくちゃいけなかったの。\n……それだけ。", "zh": "我无论如何都必须赢。\n……仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1039_024ann", "source_sha256": "607f97431dc1af19898f70a08590008402ab9a356e39b83fdc1cd76db3a6f43a", "ja": "（なるちゃんはきっと、嘘を吐いたわけじゃなくて。\n真実を、勝負に利用しただけ……）", "zh": "（小奈她一定不是在撒谎。\n只是利用了真相来进行比赛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "208b4488ba33caed32da031e2546743c4684911a3abb94ac1fe18d8318799376", "ja": "（私に話してくれた気持ちは、本当で……\nだったら……）", "zh": "（她和我说的那些心情，是真的……\n既然这样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "00f8e481e2d2b35c3725d89960d19544b1bc97cbbe09ddb39a0dc8eef9f05888", "ja": "わかった。\n今回は、私の負け。", "zh": "我知道了。\n这次，是我输了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1042_024ann", "source_sha256": "495ac48bb1af0fd8681e10aed5258091155a9cb09a5a3699dc429f20554d35d0", "ja": "でも、友達を騙すのは悪いことだと思う！\nすっごく悪い！　謝って！", "zh": "可是，我觉得欺骗朋友是不对的！\n真的非常不对！道歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "89cf40e558889a871ac4dd9ea4e6d09b2e124fbadba3ded3466225cc5b092a0d", "ja": "うん……ふふ。\n真珠星ちゃん、本当にごめんなさい。許してくれる？", "zh": "嗯……呵呵。\n珍珠星，真的很对不起。你能原谅我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "a06cd44407fa8445c370b10defe6b88e3ec2b9699628c1bf389558d44d0b29aa", "ja": "……わかった、いいよ。\n今回は、許してあげる。", "zh": "……知道了，好吧。\n这次就原谅你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1045_024ann", "source_sha256": "7b83573c838972f735fc3cfbee450a8cf872583775f320bd5e4b57162f1dd634", "ja": "でも、次は絶対騙されないし、負けないから！\n覚悟しておいて！", "zh": "不过，下次我绝对不会再被骗，也不会输给你！\n做好觉悟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_05_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "4a1a61e33a3804fe8b1e588983b2c797b6e8dbbf6d897249e2c86d2dc4803769", "ja": "うん。……楽しみにしてるね。", "zh": "嗯……我会期待着的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
